<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94012" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐδηρ-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑτ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
		fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐδηρ-ῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>: 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐδᾱρίτας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ὁ</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of
				iron</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πόλεμος</span>
			<i>iron</i> war, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				5.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τέχνη</span> the
			<i>smith's</i> art, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				263
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πέτρα</span> rock <i>with
				iron ore</i> in it, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					326
				</span></i>
			 ed. Berol., <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδηρῖτις</span>, with or without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span>, <i>loadstone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1005c
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>a precious stone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.58
			</span></i>, al.; used as remedy for snake-bite, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				361
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				390
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				419
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδηρῖτις, ἡ</span>, <i>ironwort, Sideritis romana</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πόα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοτάνη ἡ ς.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					3.7.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.885
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> also applied
			by <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> to <i>burnet, Poterium Sanguisorba</i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.34
			</span></i>; <i>Cretan fig-wort, Scrophularia lucida</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				35
			</span></i>; <i>Achilles' woundwort, Achillea tomentosa</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλξίνη</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				85
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμαίπιτυς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.158
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστερεὼν ὕπτιος</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.60
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
